# Phase 6 checks for reservations: the lists and the detail, the booking form (an event and an equipment
# rental), the customer's cancel and change request, the rental stock on a date, and the admin's actions
# and edits (VS Code REST Client: click "Send Request" above a block). Start the API first (npm run dev:api)
# and load the sample data (npm run seed:api). The changes made here stay in the database: run
# npm run seed:api again afterwards.
#
# The customer requests need a customer token and the admin requests an admin token: get them with the
# sign-in requests at the top of catalog.http, and paste them into @customerToken and @adminToken below.
# Dates are counted from today ({{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}} is 45 days from now), so they stay in the
# future; pick another offset if that day is blocked or already has an event.
# Errors come back as { code, message, meta }; meta.field names the form input the message belongs to.

@api = http://localhost:4000/api
@customerToken = paste-a-customer-token
@adminToken = paste-an-admin-token
@ref = RES-2026-1006-01

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Customer: reads

### The signed-in customer's bookings, newest first. Never the admin's private notes.
GET {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### One of the customer's own bookings in full (package, menu, add-ons, payments, review).
### Another customer's booking is 404 NOT_FOUND, never 403.
GET {{api}}/reservations/{{ref}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Rental stock on a date: { itemId: { left, status } }, status available / limited / out.
### No date: {}. A day that does not exist: 400 INVALID, meta.field "date"
GET {{api}}/rentals/availability?date={{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Customer: booking form

### A buffet: 201 with the new booking's summary (status pending, estimate = package + guests x the price per person).
### A blocked or full date: 409 DATE_UNAVAILABLE; an overlapping start time: 409 TIME_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packageId": "pkg-1",
  "serviceType": "Buffet and Catering",
  "eventName": "Santos Family Reunion",
  "occasion": "Reunion",
  "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}",
  "startTime": "17:00",
  "guests": 120,
  "menu": { "pork": "Lechon kawali", "chicken": "Chicken inasal", "fish": "Sweet and sour fish", "vegetable": "Chopsuey" },
  "foodNotes": "One vegetarian table",
  "addonIds": ["add-waiters"],
  "addonQty": { "add-waiters": 3 },
  "venueName": "Barangay Hall",
  "venueAddress": "Poblacion",
  "city": "Malvar, Batangas",
  "accessNotes": ""
}

### An equipment rental picked up at our place: 201. More pieces than are free that day: 409 OUT_OF_STOCK, meta.field "rental.<itemId>"
POST {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "packageId": "pkg-equipment-rental",
  "eventName": "Backyard birthday",
  "occasion": "Birthday",
  "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 46 d}}",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "fulfilment": "pickup",
  "rentalItems": [{ "itemId": "inv-001", "qty": 50 }]
}

### Guests out of range: 400 INVALID "Guests must be between 50 and 2000.", meta.field "guests"
POST {{api}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "packageId": "pkg-1", "serviceType": "Catering only", "eventName": "Too small", "occasion": "Birthday", "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}", "startTime": "12:00", "guests": 10, "venueName": "Hall", "venueAddress": "1 St", "city": "Lipa" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Customer: cancel and change request

### Cancel online, when the summary's onlineCancel allows it: the summary with status "cancelled" and cancelledBy "customer".
### Unpaid: any time before the event day. Paid: until cancelDeadline and before "Started preparing" (preparing_at),
### else 409 INVALID_STATE with the reason. A payment still being verified: 409 PENDING_PAYMENT.
### Equipment still checked out for it (inventory_allocations, an event's or a rental's): 409 INVALID_STATE
### "Some of the equipment for this booking is already out, so it can no longer be cancelled online."
POST {{api}}/reservations/{{ref}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "We moved the celebration to next year." }

### Ask for a change: "Change request: …" in the customer's chat, unread for the admin -> { threadId }
POST {{api}}/reservations/{{ref}}/change-request
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Please change the guest count from 150 to 170." }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Admin

### Every booking, newest first (with the admin's notes). A customer's token here: 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{api}}/admin/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### One booking in full
GET {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rental stock with the booking being edited left out (excludeRef counts for an admin only)
GET {{api}}/rentals/availability?date={{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 45 d}}&excludeRef={{ref}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Admin: actions (Phase 6B)
### Each answers with the booking's summary. A customer's token: 403 FORBIDDEN. An unknown ref: 404 NOT_FOUND.

### Send (or re-send) the quotation. The food is worked out from the guests and the booking's price per person;
### amounts are whole pesos from 0 to 10,000,000 (else 400 INVALID naming the box). deliveryFee counts for a
### delivered rental only. A total below what was paid is sent anyway: the chat says the overpaid amount.
### Declined, cancelled or completed: 409 INVALID_STATE
POST {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/quotation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "addonPrices": { "add-waiters": 800 }, "otherCharges": 2000, "otherLabel": "2 extra hours", "discount": 500, "note": "Thank you for booking with us." }

### Approve a pending request (needs a quotation: 409 NO_QUOTATION). A full date: 409 CAPACITY; a clashing start
### time: 409 TIME_UNAVAILABLE; a rental with too few pieces free: 409 OUT_OF_STOCK; a blocked date: 409 DATE_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Decline a pending request; the reason (at least 5 characters, else 400 INVALID) goes to the customer's chat
POST {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "We are fully booked on this date." }

### Confirm a booking whose downpayment is verified (Downpayment paid only, else 409 INVALID_STATE)
POST {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Mark a confirmed event completed, on or after its date. A rental with pieces still out, or a stale quotation: 409
POST {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cancel an approved to confirmed booking (a pending one is declined instead); cancelled_by "admin".
### A payment being verified: 409 PENDING_PAYMENT; equipment still checked out: 409 INVALID_STATE
POST {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Our kitchen cannot take this date after all." }

### "Started preparing" (Downpayment paid or Confirmed): the customer can no longer cancel online
POST {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/preparing
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Take "Started preparing" back (marked by mistake)
DELETE {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/preparing
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Admin: edits (Phase 6B)

### Date, start time, guests and venue -> { changed }. A new guest count on a quoted buffet posts the old and new
### food total in the customer's chat and leaves the quotation out of date until it is re-sent.
PATCH {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/logistics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 50 d}}", "startTime": "18:00", "guests": 150, "venueName": "Barangay Hall", "venueAddress": "Poblacion", "city": "Malvar, Batangas", "accessNotes": "" }

### Service type, the four menu lines and the food notes -> { ok: true }. An equipment rental: 400 INVALID
PUT {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serviceType": "Buffet and Catering", "menu": { "pork": "Lechon kawali", "chicken": "Chicken inasal", "fish": "Sweet and sour fish", "vegetable": "Chopsuey" }, "foodNotes": "" }

### The admin's private notes -> { ok: true } (never in a customer's answer)
PUT {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Call the venue a day before for the gate pass." }

### A rental's whole new list -> { changed }. Booked lines keep their prices; a line below what is checked out: 400 INVALID
PUT {{api}}/admin/reservations/{{ref}}/rental-items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "itemId": "inv-001", "qty": 60 }] }
